<odoo>
    <!--
        Model catalogue. Editable data: administrators can add, edit or remove
        models from the UI, so it is seeded once and never overwritten.

        Model ids and prices below were taken from the providers' official model
        and pricing pages (OpenAI, Google Gemini, xAI). Prices are per million
        tokens. Re-verify before relying on the cost dashboard, as catalogues
        change frequently. Reasoning models that reject sampling parameters have
        supports_temperature set to False.
    -->

